  "name": "LT - Voice Agent V1 Outbound Dialer (Vapi)",
  "description": "Outbound Vapi dialer. Mon-Fri 9am-5pm CT only. Fetches queue, re-checks GHL phone before calling, releases lock if phone missing.",
